Built-in wallpaper artwork — CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)

The media files under `lib/assets/packs/` (WebP stills and WebM loops) are
generated procedurally by `scripts/gen-assets.py` from gradients, sine waves
and polygon shapes. No third-party photographs, fonts, or video footage are
used, so the generated output is released under CC0 1.0:

  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

You may copy, modify, distribute and use these assets for any purpose without
